From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:42:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 28/33] MIPS: configs: ad5x: Enable the DMA controller

The X2600's DMA controller is now described; build its driver.
---
 arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
index fa800ee46..2501dc26f 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
@@ -31,6 +31,8 @@ CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS=y
 # CONFIG_HWMON is not set
 # CONFIG_HID is not set
 # CONFIG_USB_SUPPORT is not set
+CONFIG_DMADEVICES=y
+CONFIG_DMA_JZ4780=y
 # CONFIG_INGENIC_TIMER is not set
 CONFIG_INGENIC_X2600_OST=y
 # CONFIG_IOMMU_SUPPORT is not set
